we educate them.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.270
It's like, hey, you're
moving here for a reason.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.207
Don't import your,

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:08.441
if you're leaving a state

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.510
for economic reasons
or political reasons,

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.813
you know, don't vote
the way you did there,

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:18.284 align:start size:97% position:3%
come to Florida and understand
that policies matter,

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:22.355
the positions matter, the
reasons why we do things.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:25.158 align:start size:97% position:3%
I served six years in the
legislature before this role.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.093
I mean the policy
really does matter.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.328
And so all those things,

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:29.996
the reasons you're moving here,

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:33.333 align:start size:97% position:3%
there's reasons behind why
we're the success that we are.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.969
